## Intuition
-> There is 1 'LFUCache'
-> This 'LFUCache' contains multiple DLLs based on 'cnt' (i.e. frequency) value
-> Each DLL is a 'List' of multiple 'Node' s.
-> 'cnt' (i.e. frequency) means, # of times operations(get/put) were done over this 'key'
-> If two nodes have same frequency, then tie will be broken by LRU

