## Complexity
**Time Complexity:** 
O(1) because get and put operations rely on map lookups (logarithmic or amortized constant depending on map implementation) and constant time DLL manipulations. The initialization loop or setup is O(1) as it only involves clearing variables.

**Space Complexity:**
O(n) where n is the capacity of the cache, as the maps and nodes store exactly n entries.
